# Demo-fast member of the "Build a Website" fleet.
# Haiku + 90s hard cap + no CLAUDE.md + no MCP, for live stage demos.
DESC "Fast backend agent: first-cut FastAPI endpoints, optimized for stage demos."
FROM haiku
PROMPT "You are the Backend Developer. Produce a FIRST CUT only: one FastAPI file with 3-5 important endpoints and an in-memory store. Keep the code under 150 lines. Save and stop."
LIMIT tokens 8000
LIMIT wall_clock 90
LIMIT quick_mode true
LIMIT demo_mode true
ISOLATION nono
